44
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:45,400
Well a blender is a machine that turns the things inside it around.

45
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:47,120
So it mixes them together.

46
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:53,380
But a juicer is different because a juicer will actually take the juice from the fruit.

47
00:02:53,780 --> 00:03:01,100
So for example, if I have an orange and I cut the orange in half, I put that half on the juicer and it turns around so that the juice will come down.

48
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:04,760
Because otherwise I have to use my hands to squeeze it and that takes time.

49
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:09,300
So this is an electronic appliance that helps me get the juice from my fruits.

50
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:10,140
That's right.

51
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,960
Okay.

52
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:19,560
