96
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:17,700
Okay.

97
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:26,880
So a steamer is something that we normally use with vegetables or in Asia, a lot of times we use it with dumplings, these little foods that are stuffed.

98
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:35,440
And so, a steamer is something that you use to cook a food but with the steam from hot water.

99
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,440
That's right.

100
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:42,680
You don't put the food in the water, you don't fry the food, but you use the steam, that hot air, to cook the food inside.

101
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:42,890
That's right.

102
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:50,090
So it's actually considered to be some of the, one of the healthiest ways of cooking food because it's not as oily.

103
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:50,870
That's right.

104
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,680
