Yeah, that's right.

121
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:52,460
You can make a little bundle of trash and it's much easier than throwing a big bag of trash away.

122
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
Exactly.

123
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Okay.

124
