I never had a trash compactor in my home in America, but we always had a dishwasher and a dishwasher.

163
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:12,680
This was very, very nice to have because you don't have to wash the dishes by yourself.

164
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:16,280
You put them in the machine and the machine washes them.

165
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:21,520
