You have to put them in the sink and water for a while and then you take them out and then you put it in the dishwasher, right?

167
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:33,400
No, what we usually did is if there was food on the plate, we'd take the food and we'd put it in the trash.

168
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:42,240
And if it's, you know, sometimes you leave the plate for like a day or two and it's very dirty, you put some water on it because otherwise it will be hard and it will never come off.

169
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:53,000
